    "heading": "Level 3: Cleric Subclass",
    "lineStart": 2676,
    "lineEnd": 2678
  },
  "section": "3.63",
  "rulesText": "You gain a Cleric subclass of your choice. The Life Domain subclass is detailed after this class's description. A subclass is a specialization that grants you features at certain Cleric levels. For the rest of your career, you gain each of your subclass's features that are of your Cleric level or lower."
}
